---
title: Implemented optional Studio submission and lease
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor M as Studio JS client
    participant S as Studio JS I/O worker
    participant F as Rust web host
    participant A as Python Studio API
    participant D as PostgreSQL Store
    participant W as Packaging worker
    participant O as Digest artifact directory
    participant P as Preview listener
    Note over M,P: Repository implementation. Services require explicit configuration.<br/>There is no current Studio Browser Rust controller.
    M->>S: Build pinned static-web intent
    S->>F: Dispatch game.build.submit
    F->>F: Admit typed request
    F->>A: Forward admitted request
    A->>A: Validate source and profile
    A->>D: Commit job and event
    D-->>A: Durable receipt
    A-->>F: Correlated receipt
    F-->>S: Checked receipt
    S-->>M: Build ID and state
    W->>D: Claim lease and attempt
    D-->>W: Pinned source recipe
    W->>W: Package approved Git subtree
    W->>O: Publish verified artifact
    W->>D: Finish only current lease
    Note over D,W: Cancellation clears attempt token.<br/>Expired claims retry up to three total attempts.
    M->>S: Poll build ID and event cursor
    S->>F: Dispatch game.build.get
    F->>A: Forward after admission
    A->>D: Read scoped status and events
    D-->>A: Status and ordered events
    A-->>F: Correlated result
    F-->>S: Admitted response
    S-->>M: Render build state
    M->>S: Request artifact access
    S->>F: Dispatch artifact request
    F->>A: Forward after admission
    A-->>F: Metadata and signed URL
    F-->>S: Checked artifact response
    S-->>M: Authorized preview location
    M->>P: Open signed preview
    P->>O: Read and verify artifact
    O-->>P: Immutable preview content
    P-->>M: Preview on separate origin
